  "Stop asking for the ball to feet.",
  "Here's what I learned watching Saka.",
  "I broke down his games at Arsenal.",
  "One. When his full-back is close, he runs in behind.",
  "That's where his best chances came from.",
  "Two. When his full-back gets the ball, he darts inside.",
  "So he receives facing the middle, not the touchline.",
  "Three. On a cross from the other side, he attacks the far post.",
  "If that's blocked, he cuts back to the middle for the shot.",
  "Four. Fewer touches.",
  "One extra touch, and his shot got blocked.",
  "At that level, two touches beats three.",
  "So next game, don't just come short. Run.",
  "Follow for the next one. The free analysis test is in my bio."
